---
// Conteúdo da seção "Visual Tour / Features"
---

<section id="features" class="py-20">
  <div class="text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold uppercase">
      Explore the PostPulsar Features
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-foreground/70">
      A quick look at the powerful features available.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div id="features-accordion" class="mt-12 mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>Mission Control & Advanced Settings</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          Your central dashboard for content generation. Paste your URL, select
          networks, and dive into advanced settings to customize character
          limits and fine-tune AI prompts.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/Mission%20Control.png"
          alt="PostPulsar Dashboard"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>AI-Powered Content Generation</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          Watch as our AI transforms your source material into a variety of
          ready-to-publish posts, perfectly tailored for each social network's
          style and format.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/linkedin-post-linkedintwiter.png"
          alt="AI-Generated Content"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>Review and Refine Every Post</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          You have full control. Edit the generated text, add media like images
          and videos, and fine-tune every detail before it goes live.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/facebookpost.png"
          alt="Editing a post"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>Keep Track of Your Content</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          Every post you publish is saved to your history. Easily review past
          content or even reopen it in the dashboard for repurposing.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/Post%20History.png"
          alt="Post History Page"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>Connect Your Social Networks</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          Connect all your accounts like LinkedIn, Twitter, and Instagram for
          seamless, one-click publishing.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/Available%20Networks"
          alt="Available Networks"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>Seamless App Integrations</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          Connect directly to apps like Discord and Telegram using webhooks and
          bot tokens for direct publishing to your communities.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/App%20Integrations.png"
          alt="App Integrations Page"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>Flexible Plans & Billing</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          Manage your subscription, view billing history, and purchase extra
          'Pulse' packs whenever you need them, all from your account settings.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/Subscription%20Plans.png"
          alt="Subscription Plans"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group border border-border/50 p-6">
      <summary
        class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <span>Manage Your Account</span>
        <span
          class="transition-transform transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-6 h-6"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg
          >
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mb-4">
          A dedicated page to manage your profile, password, and security
          settings.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/settings.png"
          alt="Settings Page"
          class="rounded-md border border-border cursor-pointer feature-image"
        />
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
